    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽不难过了，她说她现在每天都很快乐。",
      "traditional": "麗麗不難過了，她說她現在每天都很快樂。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bù nán guò le tā shuō tā xiàn zài měi tiān dōu hěn kuài lè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili isn’t sad anymore; she says that now, she is very happy every day."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我很高兴，她现在不想分手的事情了，也不想她的前男友小何了。",
      "traditional": "我很高興，她現在不想分手的事情了，也不想她的前男友小何了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hěn gāo xìng tā xiàn zài bù xiǎng fēn shǒu de shì qing le yě bù xiǎng tā de qián nán yǒu xiǎo hé le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m very happy that now, she isn’t thinking about her breakup and doesn’t miss her ex-boyfriend Little He anymore."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "她说我是她最好的朋友，我真的太高兴了。",
      "traditional": "她說我是她最好的朋友，我真的太高興了。",
      "pinyin": "tā shuō wǒ shì tā zuì hǎo de péng you wǒ zhēn de tài gāo xìng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "She says that I am her best friend; I’m very happy."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "但是，我又有点儿不高兴：我真的希望只是她最好的朋友吗？",
      "traditional": "但是，我又有點兒不高興：我真的希望只是她最好的朋友嗎？",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì wǒ yòu yǒu diǎn'r bù gāo xìng wǒ zhēn de xī wàng zhǐ shì tā zuì hǎo de péng you ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But at the same time I’m a little unhappy: Do I really only wish to be her best friend?"
    }
  ],
